Below is the list of build error/warning regressions/improvements in
v4.17-rc5[1] compared to v4.16[2].

Summarized:
  - build errors: +6/-11
  - build warnings: +1214/-1580

JFYI, when comparing v4.17-rc5[1] to v4.17-rc4[3], the summaries are:
  - build errors: +4/-1
  - build warnings: +214/-244

Note that there may be false regressions, as some logs are incomplete.
Still, they're build errors/warnings.

Happy fixing! ;-)

Thanks to the linux-next team for providing the build service.

[1] http://kisskb.ellerman.id.au/kisskb/head/67b8d5c7081221efa252e111cd52532ec6d4266f/ (244 out of 246 configs)
[2] http://kisskb.ellerman.id.au/kisskb/head/0adb32858b0bddf4ada5f364a84ed60b196dbcda/ (all 246 configs)
